# NeizvesnY AI Companion - experimental offline processor logic
# Requires an allied @flare and a nearby allied player.
ubind @flare
radar player ally any distance @unit 1 player
jump 0 equal player null
sensor px player @x
sensor py player @y
ucontrol approach px py 6 0 0
uradar enemy any any distance 0 1 enemy
jump 10 equal enemy null
sensor ex enemy @x
sensor ey enemy @y
ucontrol target ex ey 1 0 0
end
